WEBVTT

01:30.838 --> 01:33.632
[Episode 13]

01:44.000 --> 01:45.840
I get how angry you feel,

01:45.840 --> 01:49.859
but only by planning carefully
can we catch them all in one sweep.

02:00.000 --> 02:03.640
I watched Yue die in front of me
with my own eyes.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.299
How can I be calm?

02:09.560 --> 02:12.099
Your Majesty, I'm here to escort you back...

02:24.719 --> 02:26.439
I will think twice about what I do.

02:26.439 --> 02:29.080
The Censorate will handle this case.

02:29.080 --> 02:30.639
Your Majesty, you may return.

02:30.639 --> 02:32.400
What do you plan to do next?

02:32.400 --> 02:34.039
I need to know.

02:34.039 --> 02:35.819
Otherwise, I'll be worried.

02:39.439 --> 02:42.020
Since the gambling house
has already known my identity,

02:42.719 --> 02:44.439
and Lv Da has a grudge against me,

02:44.439 --> 02:45.800
they will certainly get back at me.

02:45.800 --> 02:48.280
I believe they will come to me.

02:48.280 --> 02:50.960
They will come to you for two reasons.

02:50.960 --> 02:52.639
Either they rope you in,

02:52.639 --> 02:54.379
or they take your life.

02:55.800 --> 02:59.699
I will handle this myself.
You may go, Your Majesty.

03:26.400 --> 03:28.400
- This way, please.
- Alright.

03:28.400 --> 03:29.539
[Bofeng House]
Come again!

03:32.960 --> 03:34.719
- I'll fetch Ms. Yan.
- Okay.

03:37.440 --> 03:39.136
[May You Win]

03:42.048 --> 03:44.992
[Bofeng House]

03:46.322 --> 03:51.201
Ms. Yan, I'm Hao Wen Ming,
the major owner of Xingrong Gambling House.

03:51.201 --> 03:54.741
Today, I've come to pay a visit

03:56.122 --> 03:57.481
to Miss Meng.

03:57.481 --> 03:59.122
Nice to meet you, Mr. Hao.

03:59.122 --> 04:01.681
May I ask what you want
to see Miss Meng about?

04:01.681 --> 04:05.761
Miss Meng is not someone
you can see as you wish.

04:05.761 --> 04:07.241
Ms. Yan,

04:07.241 --> 04:11.942
I came with the utmost sincerity
and generous benefits.

04:13.002 --> 04:16.762
This kind of liquor was produced
in the extreme cold regions.

04:16.762 --> 04:18.681
The brewing process is quite complex.

04:18.681 --> 04:20.162
It tastes rich and mellow,

04:20.162 --> 04:21.861
with a lingering aftertaste.

04:22.722 --> 04:26.561
In the capital, only I can get it.

04:26.561 --> 04:29.881
I can supply this liquor
exclusively to Bofeng House

04:29.881 --> 04:33.481
at 30 percent below the market price.

04:33.481 --> 04:35.402
If you find this agreeable,

04:35.402 --> 04:38.082
we can consider this
as the start of our cooperation.

04:38.082 --> 04:42.381
And you introduce me to Miss Meng.
What do you say?

04:46.202 --> 04:50.121
It sounds quite interesting.

04:50.121 --> 04:53.262
Honored guest,
please proceed to the second floor.

04:54.202 --> 04:55.921
Madam.

04:55.921 --> 04:57.642
What did you just hear from them?

04:57.642 --> 05:00.921
Mr. Hao seems to have come
specifically to see Miss Meng.

05:00.921 --> 05:04.801
It seems Miss Meng is handling a case
related to the Xingrong Gambling House.

05:04.801 --> 05:06.842
I knew it.

05:06.842 --> 05:08.602
There must be some shady dealings

05:08.602 --> 05:11.042
between Yan Fu Zhi and Meng Ting Hui.

05:11.042 --> 05:12.681
- Sure.
- Right now,

05:12.681 --> 05:14.902
I'm going to write a complaint letter
to report them.

05:17.241 --> 05:19.282
Miss Meng.

05:19.282 --> 05:21.241
I've heard so much about you.

05:21.241 --> 05:23.202
Seeing you today,

05:23.202 --> 05:25.602
I finally understand what is gorgeous,

05:25.602 --> 05:28.602
elegant, talented,
and knowledgeable lady like.

05:28.602 --> 05:30.962
Meeting me today is an honor

05:30.962 --> 05:33.741
you will take with you
to your family's grave.

05:36.481 --> 05:37.921
No, I mean, meeting you is an honor

05:37.921 --> 05:39.902
I'll take with me to my family's grave.

05:40.602 --> 05:42.061
Don't get me wrong, please.

05:42.722 --> 05:45.921
Upon seeing you,
I become somewhat incoherent.

05:45.921 --> 05:50.321
Mr. Hao. You must be here for a reason.

05:50.321 --> 05:53.082
What brings you here today?

05:53.082 --> 05:54.762
I heard

05:54.762 --> 05:57.361
you went to my gambling house last night.

05:57.361 --> 05:59.042
I did not personally welcome you,

05:59.042 --> 06:01.082
and you didn't enjoy yourself there.

06:01.082 --> 06:03.042
I feel truly sorry.

06:03.042 --> 06:06.702
Today, I came to apologize to you.

06:07.402 --> 06:13.282
By the way, it's an honor for me

06:13.282 --> 06:14.981
to be friends with you.

06:19.722 --> 06:21.061
Miss Meng.

06:24.361 --> 06:25.542
Open it.

06:33.481 --> 06:36.602
This is of top-quality.

06:36.602 --> 06:41.241
Look, this pearl is big and round.

06:41.241 --> 06:43.561
You can spot good stuff.

06:43.561 --> 06:44.702
Buddy.

06:46.481 --> 06:47.842
This necklace is yours.

06:47.842 --> 06:50.402
- No.
- Just take it.

06:50.402 --> 06:53.522
Miss Meng and I are talking business.

06:53.522 --> 06:57.282
If it works out, we will be like family.

06:57.282 --> 06:58.481
Miss.

06:58.481 --> 07:00.642
Wen Ming is quite sincere.

07:00.642 --> 07:01.902
Consider what he said.

07:03.361 --> 07:04.662
Two more.

07:05.441 --> 07:06.441
Mr. Hao.

07:06.441 --> 07:10.241
I heard your gambling house is backed
by some powerful figures.

07:10.241 --> 07:13.241
Your business is not simple, isn't it?

07:13.241 --> 07:14.542
Miss Meng.

07:15.402 --> 07:17.921
You truly are well-informed.

07:17.921 --> 07:19.082
To be honest with you,

07:19.082 --> 07:22.722
indeed, some powerful figures
back our gambling house up.

07:22.722 --> 07:25.241
But those are just small-time connections.

07:25.241 --> 07:30.582
We need powerful figures like you
to back us up.

07:39.962 --> 07:41.681
Miss Meng.

07:41.681 --> 07:43.181
Please sit.

07:52.522 --> 07:53.642
Miss Meng.

07:53.642 --> 07:56.602
Once you sign this cooperation contract,

07:56.602 --> 08:00.801
we will be on the same boat.

08:00.801 --> 08:03.241
Since you want cooperation,

08:03.241 --> 08:06.481
you need to be very frank with me.

08:06.481 --> 08:11.241
What exactly is the business
on the second floor of your gambling house?

08:11.241 --> 08:15.162
And what is the background
of those masked gamblers?

08:15.162 --> 08:16.642
Miss Meng.

08:16.642 --> 08:19.102
Secrets can only be shared

08:19.921 --> 08:24.361
[Partner]
with those on the same boat.

08:24.361 --> 08:26.681
As long as you sign it,

08:26.681 --> 08:31.262
I guarantee I'll tell you all I know.

08:31.262 --> 08:32.824
[Contract]

08:34.882 --> 08:35.961
Miss Meng.

08:35.961 --> 08:39.441
You're hesitating, so you do not trust me?

08:39.441 --> 08:43.282
Are you unwilling to cooperate with me?

08:43.282 --> 08:45.242
I am just thinking.

08:45.242 --> 08:47.561
Just 20 percent of profits?

08:47.561 --> 08:50.662
Is it worth me risking my official position?

08:51.681 --> 08:52.801
No, it's not.

08:52.801 --> 08:54.362
I need at least

08:54.362 --> 08:55.701
- seven--
- 30 percent.

08:58.762 --> 09:00.142
30 percent.

09:01.321 --> 09:05.002
One percent less,
and our cooperation is off the table.

09:05.002 --> 09:06.762
Miss Meng.

09:06.762 --> 09:09.242
You're good at doing business.

09:09.242 --> 09:11.022
Alright, 30 percent is okay then.

09:17.482 --> 09:18.482
Get me a brush pen.

09:18.482 --> 09:20.721
Miss Meng, I have thought again.

09:20.721 --> 09:24.201
If you sign this contract,
I fear it could be a leverage against you.

09:24.201 --> 09:26.461
- Get me a brush pen.
- Come on, buddy.

09:39.207 --> 09:40.482
[Meng Ting Hui]

09:40.482 --> 09:43.341
Quite straightforward, Miss Meng.

09:45.002 --> 09:46.262
Mr. Hao.

09:47.201 --> 09:48.721
So, can you answer my questions now?

09:48.721 --> 09:51.402
Sure, since we're on the same boat now,

09:51.402 --> 09:52.801
let's talk over drinks.

09:52.801 --> 09:54.662
Bottoms up.

10:04.402 --> 10:07.162
On the second floor,

10:07.162 --> 10:12.101
some special guests need special hospitality.

10:13.162 --> 10:15.262
You know what I mean, huh?

10:16.002 --> 10:17.002
Yeah, of course.

10:17.002 --> 10:18.441
- Drink.
- Drink, buddy.

10:18.441 --> 10:19.902
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

10:23.402 --> 10:24.941
I have heard

10:25.561 --> 10:30.421
that the semi-monthly Flower Feast

10:31.402 --> 10:33.862
is very wonderful.

10:34.642 --> 10:35.862
Buddy.

10:37.721 --> 10:39.921
Buddy, come.

10:39.921 --> 10:41.122
My good buddy.

10:41.122 --> 10:46.042
I also want to go to the Flower Feast

10:46.042 --> 10:47.821
to broaden my horizons.

10:49.321 --> 10:53.762
Normally, since we are on the same boat,

10:53.762 --> 10:56.902
going up to the second floor
should not be a problem.

10:57.642 --> 10:59.061
But...

11:01.122 --> 11:02.941
What are you looking for, buddy?

11:06.122 --> 11:07.961
Tomorrow's Flower Feast

11:07.961 --> 11:10.642
is not held on our second floor.

11:10.642 --> 11:16.002
It is at our gang leader's Spring Manor
on the western outskirts of the city.

11:16.002 --> 11:18.841
That is not open to ordinary people.

11:18.841 --> 11:22.341
Even if you want to go, you have to wait.

11:24.402 --> 11:25.902
Buddy.

11:27.042 --> 11:29.642
Your gang leader is truly mysterious.

11:29.642 --> 11:32.882
The last time I saw him, he almost killed me.

11:32.882 --> 11:37.581
As the saying goes,
out of blows friendship grows.

11:38.242 --> 11:40.002
Come on, let's drink.

11:40.002 --> 11:41.282
Buddy.

11:41.282 --> 11:42.502
Miss Meng.

11:43.201 --> 11:45.262
What is your gang leader's name?

11:48.201 --> 11:50.581
Ling Yun Fei.

11:51.362 --> 11:53.681
Ling Yun Fei.

11:53.681 --> 11:56.282
Fei.

11:56.282 --> 11:58.101
Fei.

12:08.162 --> 12:10.681
<i>She is just a greedy female official.</i>

12:10.681 --> 12:15.321
<i>Since she signed the contract,
she will have to do what I say.</i>

12:15.321 --> 12:19.681
Master, Meng Ting Hui signed the contract.

12:19.681 --> 12:21.201
She won't be able to interfere

12:21.201 --> 12:23.601
[Meng Ting Hui]
with our business anymore.

12:23.601 --> 12:25.042
Rest assured,

12:25.042 --> 12:26.721
Master.

12:26.721 --> 12:28.921
These officials

12:28.921 --> 12:31.282
appear righteous on the surface,

12:31.282 --> 12:33.402
but are corrupt and scheming inside.

12:33.402 --> 12:34.961
They fear exposure the most.

12:34.961 --> 12:36.242
Over these years,

12:36.242 --> 12:40.561
we have used contracts
to control many officials in the capital.

12:40.561 --> 12:43.701
It seems Meng Ting Hui

12:44.402 --> 12:46.341
is nothing special at all.

12:49.201 --> 12:52.201
Meng Ting Hui almost died at my hands,

12:52.201 --> 12:53.882
but she didn't look afraid.

12:53.882 --> 12:55.482
And you handled her with just a drink?

12:55.482 --> 12:57.162
More than just a drink.

12:57.162 --> 12:59.162
I also gave her
a large box of gold, silver, and jewels.

12:59.162 --> 13:01.561
She also gets 30 percent
of the gambling house's profits.

13:01.561 --> 13:03.122
You are quite generous.

13:03.122 --> 13:06.502
How many secrets did you reveal to her
after you got drunk?

13:16.642 --> 13:18.022
Miss Meng, be careful.

13:19.081 --> 13:22.122
The place for Flower Feast
is even more remote than I imagined.

13:22.122 --> 13:23.242
Miss Meng, don't worry.

13:23.242 --> 13:26.122
As long as we follow Hao Wen Ming's carriage,
we'll locate the feast.

13:26.122 --> 13:29.642
Miss Meng, His Majesty has not yet replied
to our memorial.

13:29.642 --> 13:31.362
Our acting without authorization
is already exceeding our authority.

13:31.362 --> 13:32.441
Here you go again.

13:32.441 --> 13:35.402
If we wait for His Majesty's reply,
it will be too late.

13:35.402 --> 13:37.282
If you are afraid, just go back.

13:37.282 --> 13:40.242
If I were afraid, I would not be here.

13:40.242 --> 13:41.801
I work in the Censorate by imperial decree

13:41.801 --> 13:43.402
and act by law,

13:43.402 --> 13:45.441
while you only know how to play petty,

13:45.441 --> 13:46.762
self-defeating tricks.

13:46.762 --> 13:48.681
Self-defeating tricks?

13:48.681 --> 13:51.601
Listen, laws mean nothing

13:51.601 --> 13:53.122
to the Huxiao Gang.

13:53.122 --> 13:56.801
Stop arguing. Just play it by ear.

13:56.801 --> 13:59.542
Let's follow the carriage first,
but be sure to keep our distance.

14:48.642 --> 14:49.642
No!

14:58.282 --> 14:59.782
Get away!

15:08.721 --> 15:10.701
You're indeed smart.

15:11.441 --> 15:13.242
According to our guards,

15:13.242 --> 15:16.522
Meng Ting Hui has gone to the Spring Manor
with two of her trusted persons.

15:16.522 --> 15:19.181
Everything is under your control.

15:20.841 --> 15:24.002
<i>How many secrets did you reveal to her
after you got drunk?</i>

15:24.002 --> 15:27.441
Master, don't worry,
just small talk with her the whole time.

15:27.441 --> 15:29.042
I also set her up.

15:29.042 --> 15:31.482
I deliberately revealed a fake place
for the Flower Feast.

15:31.482 --> 15:33.882
Even if she goes,
it will be a wild goose chase.

15:33.882 --> 15:35.221
That is not enough.

15:36.162 --> 15:37.862
If she comes,

15:38.482 --> 15:40.902
I will make sure she never returns.

15:51.122 --> 15:53.242
He abandoned the carriage. Well...

15:53.242 --> 15:54.681
Has he arrived?

15:54.681 --> 15:56.061
Go take a look.

15:58.201 --> 15:59.301
Miss Meng.

16:32.762 --> 16:33.902
Run!

16:38.642 --> 16:40.042
Is the amount of gunpowder enough?

16:40.042 --> 16:41.441
Sure, Master.

16:41.441 --> 16:43.622
We will definitely blast them to dust.

17:07.482 --> 17:10.762
I heard that Xiyan flowers
are popular in Beijian.

17:10.762 --> 17:13.401
Many musicians often use this flower
as an adornment.

17:13.401 --> 17:16.601
So I had them decorate the banquet
with these flowers.

17:16.601 --> 17:18.581
Are you happy with it?

17:19.401 --> 17:22.002
We appreciate Your Majesty's kindness.

17:22.002 --> 17:24.641
But Beijian is bitterly cold all year round.

17:24.641 --> 17:26.601
We have always prized the snow lotus.

17:26.601 --> 17:28.641
So this kind of Xiyan flower
is not commonly seen.

17:28.641 --> 17:30.482
I see.

17:30.482 --> 17:33.641
No wonder many of the treasures
your country offered this time

17:33.641 --> 17:35.722
are all exquisitely carved
with snow lotus patterns.

17:35.722 --> 17:37.522
Now I understand.

17:37.522 --> 17:40.321
By order of our lord,
we've come to visit Your Majesty.

17:40.321 --> 17:43.442
We wish that Beijian
and the Ning Empire will forever be allied.

17:43.442 --> 17:46.962
We also wish
to be good neighbors with Beijian

17:46.962 --> 17:48.621
and stabilize the borders together.

18:22.242 --> 18:25.502
Zhi Li.

18:30.601 --> 18:31.861
Miss Meng.

18:34.321 --> 18:36.601
Miss Meng, you are injured.

18:36.601 --> 18:38.121
I have medicine.

18:38.121 --> 18:39.542
Are you alright?

18:43.442 --> 18:46.101
Yin Qing, are you okay?

18:46.881 --> 18:48.182
I'm fine.

18:49.561 --> 18:51.381
My superficial wound is nothing serious.

18:58.161 --> 19:01.641
This carriage was not heading
to the Spring Manor at all.

19:01.641 --> 19:03.601
But now, how do we get to the Flower Feast?

19:03.601 --> 19:06.502
I know where it really is now.

19:19.321 --> 19:20.502
Master.

19:35.601 --> 19:36.702
Stop!

19:43.282 --> 19:44.381
Don't move!

19:45.482 --> 19:46.502
Don't move!

19:50.962 --> 19:52.621
Don't move! Kneel!

19:53.321 --> 19:55.141
You bunch of wretches!

19:58.561 --> 20:00.722
Miss Meng, buddy.

20:00.722 --> 20:04.401
Are you trying to destroy my place?

20:04.401 --> 20:07.081
Hao Wen Ming,
you rely on the power of the Huxiao Gang,

20:07.081 --> 20:08.282
using gambling as a front

20:08.282 --> 20:09.282
to traffic women.

20:09.282 --> 20:10.762
Now we've caught you red-handed.

20:10.762 --> 20:13.841
Miss Meng, you're slandering innocent people.

20:13.841 --> 20:15.682
We are just hosting a banquet.

20:15.682 --> 20:16.841
And they just played a little game.

20:16.841 --> 20:18.242
A little game?

20:18.242 --> 20:19.801
Treating women shamefully

20:19.801 --> 20:22.682
is what you call a little game?

20:22.682 --> 20:26.722
Miss Meng, don't be so angry.

20:26.722 --> 20:28.841
We are all on the same side.

20:28.841 --> 20:29.881
You wish!

20:29.881 --> 20:33.502
Miss Meng is a woman of integrity.
How dare you slander her!

20:37.442 --> 20:42.282
Buddy, how can you turn your back on me?

20:42.282 --> 20:45.442
- The other day, I gave you an expensive--
- Shut up!

20:45.442 --> 20:46.881
- Arrest them!
- Wait!

20:46.881 --> 20:48.422
This is outrageous!

20:55.002 --> 20:59.081
Right under the Emperor's nose,
there is such an immoral affair.

20:59.081 --> 21:00.361
You came at the perfect time.

21:00.361 --> 21:01.442
Mr. Zheng.

21:01.442 --> 21:02.601
These wretches--

21:02.601 --> 21:04.121
I've received a report from civilians

21:04.121 --> 21:05.962
that Meng Ting Hui has accepted bribes

21:05.962 --> 21:07.401
and gathered a crowd for lewd activities.

21:07.401 --> 21:08.962
I am here specifically to investigate it.

21:08.962 --> 21:10.321
Lewd activities?

21:10.321 --> 21:12.722
Miss Meng is here handling a case.
There must be a misunderstanding.

21:12.722 --> 21:15.682
I've already sent people to Bofeng House
to search and find the illicit goods.

21:15.682 --> 21:18.702
Whether there is a misunderstanding or not,
we will know soon enough.

21:23.242 --> 21:24.542
[Bofeng House]
Hurry up!

21:25.722 --> 21:28.002
Sirs, what has happened?

21:28.002 --> 21:30.042
- Search!
- Yes!

21:30.042 --> 21:32.361
Wait! What are you doing?

21:32.361 --> 21:35.242
Listen to me, Mr. Zheng.

21:35.242 --> 21:37.002
Meng Ting Hui bullied me with her power.

21:37.002 --> 21:39.282
She forced me to sign a contract

21:39.282 --> 21:42.121
to take 30 percent
of my gambling house's profits.

21:42.121 --> 21:44.821
She threatened that if I didn't comply,

21:45.762 --> 21:48.321
she would make trouble for my gambling house.

21:48.321 --> 21:49.782
Hao Wen Ming.

21:50.561 --> 21:53.922
You're just slandering me.

21:53.922 --> 21:56.121
Mr. Zheng, please look at this.

21:56.121 --> 21:57.962
It is written in black and white.

21:57.962 --> 22:00.782
It has Meng Ting Hui's signature on it.

22:16.881 --> 22:17.881
What?

22:17.881 --> 22:20.321
Mr. Hao, where is my signature?

22:20.321 --> 22:23.801
How dare you slander an official!

22:23.801 --> 22:26.881
Miss Meng, Mr. Hao must not be sober yet.

22:26.881 --> 22:28.841
Are you messing with me?

22:28.841 --> 22:31.682
Mr. Hao, you gave her
a box of gold, silver, and jewels.

22:31.682 --> 22:34.161
Right, I gave her a box of jewels.

22:34.161 --> 22:37.301
She also extorted a box of jewels
from me as a deposit.

22:41.161 --> 22:44.821
Sir, these are the illicit goods
we found at Bofeng House.

22:46.641 --> 22:49.042
This is the evidence.

22:49.042 --> 22:52.482
Mr. Zheng, please seek justice for us.

22:52.482 --> 22:55.841
This is my private property,
not illicit goods.

22:55.841 --> 22:56.881
Nonsense!

22:56.881 --> 22:59.161
You are a lowly sixth-rank official
and just took office.

22:59.161 --> 23:00.282
Where would you get so much money?

23:00.282 --> 23:02.922
It was a gift from her good friend, Ms. Yan,

23:02.922 --> 23:06.081
to thank Miss Meng for devising strategies
to manage Bofeng House.

23:06.081 --> 23:09.042
Nonsense! This was all mine!

23:09.042 --> 23:10.482
Let me tell you,

23:10.482 --> 23:12.361
this box is specially made
by our gambling house.

23:12.361 --> 23:14.561
It's engraved
with the seal of my gambling house.

23:14.561 --> 23:16.242
Do you dare to let them check?

23:16.242 --> 23:19.202
Why check my superior's property?

23:19.202 --> 23:20.482
Aren't you just acting like a hooligan?

23:20.482 --> 23:23.601
It's ridiculous to determine ownership
based solely on the seal.

23:23.601 --> 23:25.601
I do not accept it.

23:25.601 --> 23:27.762
You are totally unreasonable.

23:27.762 --> 23:31.202
If the bottom of the box is engraved
with the seal of my gambling house,

23:31.202 --> 23:32.321
then it is my stuff.

23:32.321 --> 23:35.522
If it is engraved with Bofeng House's seal,
then it is yours.

23:35.522 --> 23:36.942
Are you afraid now?

23:38.722 --> 23:40.321
Move aside!

23:40.321 --> 23:41.621
Get your hands off!

23:46.922 --> 23:49.101
Sir, please check it out.

23:55.282 --> 23:56.341
What?

23:58.016 --> 24:00.161
[Bofeng House]

24:00.161 --> 24:01.462
Mr. Hao.

24:02.202 --> 24:03.482
You just said

24:03.482 --> 24:05.482
this stuff belongs to the owner

24:05.482 --> 24:07.881
of the seal engraved
on the bottom of the box.

24:07.881 --> 24:09.922
Mr. Zheng, soldiers,

24:09.922 --> 24:11.361
you have also seen with your own eyes.

24:11.361 --> 24:13.682
The bottom of this box is engraved
with the seal of Bofeng House.

24:13.682 --> 24:16.061
So naturally, it is Miss Meng's stuff.

24:20.881 --> 24:21.881
Hao Wen Ming.

24:21.881 --> 24:24.321
From the moment you handed over the contract,

24:24.321 --> 24:26.141
you already lost.

24:26.762 --> 24:30.061
I have played along with you.
Are you satisfied?

24:30.881 --> 24:32.801
Meng Ting Hui.

24:32.801 --> 24:34.641
You...

24:34.641 --> 24:38.002
Mr. Zheng, don't listen to her.

24:38.002 --> 24:39.522
She must have tampered with evidence.

24:39.522 --> 24:42.061
You must seek justice for us.

24:43.002 --> 24:45.561
Meng Ting Hui, you have always acted oddly.

24:45.561 --> 24:48.922
It's difficult to clear your suspicion
with just a few words from your side.

24:48.922 --> 24:50.202
Come back with me to the Supreme Court.

24:50.202 --> 24:53.202
If you are innocent,
I will naturally let you go.

24:53.202 --> 24:56.222
The Supreme Court has no right
to interfere with the Censorate's cases.

24:57.002 --> 24:59.202
If you want to interrogate me,

24:59.202 --> 25:01.442
you'll have to let me escort the criminals
to the Censorate first.

25:01.442 --> 25:03.641
I am acting by law.

25:03.641 --> 25:05.462
Why should I listen to you?

25:06.722 --> 25:09.442
That man is wearing a red jade ring
on his thumb,

25:09.442 --> 25:11.702
carved with a caged bird on it.

25:19.042 --> 25:21.482
You are the one who brutally murdered Yue!

25:21.482 --> 25:23.161
You colluded with Hao Wen Ming

25:23.161 --> 25:26.042
and these gamblers
who participated in the Flower Feast.

25:26.042 --> 25:28.922
Today, you did not come sincerely
to investigate the case.

25:28.922 --> 25:30.742
You came for me.

25:32.601 --> 25:35.002
Meng Ting Hui, stop talking nonsense!

25:35.002 --> 25:36.922
Yue's testimony is at the Censorate.

25:36.922 --> 25:40.422
If you deny it,
we can confront it on the spot.

25:43.361 --> 25:47.321
You're just a lowly sixth-rank official.
What can you do to me?

25:47.321 --> 25:49.361
[Censorate]
Open your eyes and see.

25:49.361 --> 25:51.361
This is a token bestowed by His Majesty.

25:51.361 --> 25:55.522
Between you and me,
if only one person can leave alive,

25:55.522 --> 25:57.161
it will certainly be me.

25:57.161 --> 25:58.361
Divine Guard, heed my command!

25:58.361 --> 26:02.061
Anyone who interferes will be executed
on the spot!

26:05.641 --> 26:07.262
His Majesty has come.

26:18.561 --> 26:22.242
Unmask these wretches!

26:22.242 --> 26:23.581
Yes!

26:26.242 --> 26:28.401
Isn't this Mr. Liu from the Hanlin Academy?

26:28.401 --> 26:30.442
I didn't expect to see you here.

26:30.442 --> 26:32.841
Mr. Shen, you mistook me for someone else.

26:32.841 --> 26:35.141
Isn't this Vice Minister Zhang
from the Ministry of Revenue?

26:36.002 --> 26:39.121
These guys also look quite familiar.

26:39.121 --> 26:42.682
What a group of sanctimonious scourges.

26:42.682 --> 26:45.641
Since you are all so afraid
to show your true faces,

26:45.641 --> 26:47.682
then let them be paraded in these outfits,

26:47.682 --> 26:49.962
from the gambling house to the prison.

26:49.962 --> 26:52.042
Let the people of the capital see

26:52.042 --> 26:56.121
what kind of brute wretches they are.

26:56.121 --> 26:58.962
Throw Mr. Zheng and his men
into the prison immediately

26:58.962 --> 27:00.722
for judgment.

27:00.722 --> 27:02.561
Move!

27:02.561 --> 27:04.982
You two, don't just kneel there.

27:12.401 --> 27:13.401
Your Majesty.

27:13.401 --> 27:16.641
May we send these women to the Censorate?

27:16.641 --> 27:19.381
You're in charge of this case.

27:21.401 --> 27:22.821
Thank you, Your Majesty.

27:23.522 --> 27:24.742
Yin Qing.

27:25.881 --> 27:28.061
Get up. It's over now.

27:35.081 --> 27:36.422
Thank you, Your Majesty.

27:45.561 --> 27:48.682
Well played, Miss Meng.

27:48.682 --> 27:51.121
You're becoming better at cheating.

27:51.121 --> 27:54.161
So, will you confess honestly?

27:54.161 --> 27:55.422
Or shall I...

28:10.841 --> 28:12.401
Stop pretending.

28:12.401 --> 28:14.762
There are only the two of us here.

28:14.762 --> 28:16.202
If you keep pretending,

28:16.202 --> 28:18.621
you might really have to sleep
until tomorrow morning.

28:30.442 --> 28:34.542
Your Majesty, I made huge mistakes.

28:38.361 --> 28:41.202
My first mistake was not reporting
to Your Majesty in advance.

28:41.202 --> 28:45.081
But it was because it was urgent,
and I didn't want to miss a good opportunity.

28:45.081 --> 28:49.442
My second mistake
was accepting Hao Wen Ming's stuff.

28:49.442 --> 28:52.722
But I was by no means greedy for money.
It was only to gain his trust.

28:52.722 --> 28:56.742
And I did not actually sign that contract.

29:01.841 --> 29:03.922
That's all, Your Majesty.

29:03.922 --> 29:05.682
In that case,

29:05.682 --> 29:07.682
you didn't make any mistake.

29:07.682 --> 29:09.922
Instead, you made a perfect plan.

29:09.922 --> 29:12.121
Even the timing of sending Zhi Li
to bring reinforcements

29:12.121 --> 29:14.202
was calculated without the slightest error.

29:14.202 --> 29:17.502
This allowed me
to witness it with my own eyes.

29:19.081 --> 29:21.801
I'm impressed by the friendship
between you and Ms. Yan.

29:21.801 --> 29:24.321
You even adamantly claimed
that black is white,

29:24.321 --> 29:25.641
and that the corrupt is clean.

29:25.641 --> 29:30.762
I never expected you
to have the potential to be a bad official.

29:30.762 --> 29:32.922
<i>So His Majesty knew all along.</i>

29:32.922 --> 29:34.462
Get up and speak.

29:40.641 --> 29:41.722
I wonder

29:41.722 --> 29:44.942
if I had not arrived in time today,

29:46.601 --> 29:48.482
how would you have ended this?

29:48.482 --> 29:49.762
I had the Divine Guard.

29:49.762 --> 29:51.841
Has the Divine Guard already become yours?

29:51.841 --> 29:53.742
Naturally, they belong to Your Majesty.

29:55.202 --> 29:57.401
The money from the Huxiao Gang
also belongs to Your Majesty,

29:57.401 --> 29:59.361
not under any supervision of Lord Xu.

29:59.361 --> 30:01.222
Your Majesty can spend it at will.

30:02.641 --> 30:04.121
Great.

30:04.121 --> 30:09.561
It seems you can now earn money for me.

30:09.561 --> 30:11.361
You even use money to keep my mouth shut,

30:11.361 --> 30:13.621
leaving me with no way to blame you.

30:21.282 --> 30:24.881
I humbly beg Your Majesty to forgive me once.

30:24.881 --> 30:28.161
Those women wanted to leave their hometowns
by their own efforts.

30:28.161 --> 30:29.962
They are educated and reasonable,

30:29.962 --> 30:31.821
only wishing to serve the country.

30:32.841 --> 30:36.282
It's heart-wrenching

30:36.282 --> 30:38.361
to see them suffer so much.

30:38.361 --> 30:41.182
I must seek justice for them.

30:42.722 --> 30:44.901
I beg Your Majesty.

30:50.881 --> 30:53.522
I have never said I would blame you.

30:53.522 --> 30:56.002
Yet you are asking for forgiveness now.

30:56.002 --> 30:58.022
Alright, stop pretending. Get up.

31:02.242 --> 31:03.462
Meng Ting Hui.

31:14.482 --> 31:17.661
You have a fever,
yet you still try to act tough.

32:19.922 --> 32:21.482
You are selfish and self-interested,

32:21.482 --> 32:22.841
full of lies.

32:22.841 --> 32:24.841
After being exposed, you try to argue.

32:24.841 --> 32:25.881
You're good at playing innocent

32:25.881 --> 32:27.081
and pitiful.

32:27.081 --> 32:28.361
You're so cunning, deceitful,

32:28.361 --> 32:29.442
and duplicitous.

32:29.442 --> 32:31.561
How do I know you are not deceiving me?

32:31.561 --> 32:34.542
You really have a deep impression of me.

32:37.641 --> 32:41.881
Are you proud of bullying a woman like me?

32:41.881 --> 32:44.561
If you deceive me, you'll be dead.

32:44.561 --> 32:45.801
You jinx.

32:45.801 --> 32:47.581
Don't come back, you shameless person.

32:53.841 --> 32:57.581
This time, we are completely even.

33:17.522 --> 33:21.341
So you have such a well-behaved side.

33:30.401 --> 33:32.542
Miss Meng, the medicine is ready.

33:34.282 --> 33:35.922
Your Majesty.

33:35.922 --> 33:37.722
It's so late, and you are still here.

33:37.722 --> 33:39.522
Why have you come so late?

33:39.522 --> 33:40.841
Without even knocking on the door.

33:40.841 --> 33:43.641
Your Majesty, Miss Meng was injured today

33:43.641 --> 33:46.081
and was also frightened
after being taken hostage.

33:46.081 --> 33:48.161
So I brewed a bowl of decoction for her.

33:48.161 --> 33:50.242
Let her drink it when she wakes up tomorrow.

33:50.242 --> 33:51.321
You may leave now.

33:51.321 --> 33:52.321
But...

33:54.442 --> 33:55.542
Yes.

33:56.161 --> 33:57.482
Wait.

33:57.482 --> 34:00.641
I saw that you were also injured today.

34:00.641 --> 34:02.161
Thank you for your hard work.

34:02.161 --> 34:03.702
Rest early.

34:04.762 --> 34:07.601
So Your Majesty cares about me.

34:07.601 --> 34:08.942
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:23.842 --> 34:26.161
Director of Censorate, Meng Ting Hui,

34:26.161 --> 34:28.882
has uncovered Huxiao Gang's gambling house.

34:28.882 --> 34:30.761
She has saved countless female students

34:30.761 --> 34:32.761
and eradicated treacherous officials.

34:32.761 --> 34:34.002
Her achievements are outstanding.

34:34.002 --> 34:36.842
She is hereby specially promoted
to be a fifth-rank official

34:36.842 --> 34:38.442
as a commendation.

34:38.442 --> 34:41.962
Also, the members of the Censorate
should be rewarded

34:41.962 --> 34:43.661
to honor their merits.

34:45.922 --> 34:47.661
Thank you, Your Majesty.

34:54.842 --> 34:56.022
Your Majesty.

34:56.761 --> 34:58.561
Many families

34:58.561 --> 34:59.842
were broken

34:59.842 --> 35:01.962
because of gambling.

35:01.962 --> 35:04.721
The Xingrong Gambling House is involved
in countless acts of evil.

35:04.721 --> 35:06.281
They trafficked women

35:06.281 --> 35:07.802
and roped in court officials.

35:07.802 --> 35:08.922
They've brought calamity to the people,

35:08.922 --> 35:10.922
as a great scourge for the country.

35:10.922 --> 35:13.761
I hope Your Majesty will protect all women

35:13.761 --> 35:16.362
and prevent such tragedies
from happening again.

35:16.362 --> 35:18.641
That's what I intend to do.

35:18.641 --> 35:20.042
Chief Steward You.

35:20.042 --> 35:21.042
Attention.

35:21.042 --> 35:22.561
Effective immediately,

35:22.561 --> 35:24.281
anyone who traffics in human beings,

35:24.281 --> 35:25.522
once verified,

35:25.522 --> 35:26.802
regardless of being the principal
or an accessory,

35:26.802 --> 35:28.482
shall be beheaded immediately.

35:28.482 --> 35:29.842
Their family property shall be confiscated.

35:29.842 --> 35:32.081
Their clansmen shall be exiled 3,000 li.

35:32.081 --> 35:34.522
All prefectures must strengthen patrols

35:34.522 --> 35:36.002
to prevent trafficking and fraud.

35:36.002 --> 35:37.322
If there is any negligence,

35:37.322 --> 35:38.842
it will be severely punished without mercy.

35:38.842 --> 35:42.482
Furthermore,
all gambling is banned in the Ning Empire.

35:42.482 --> 35:44.402
Anyone who operates a gambling house

35:44.402 --> 35:45.641
shall be beheaded.

35:45.641 --> 35:47.201
And their accomplices
shall be flogged 100 times

35:47.201 --> 35:48.882
and exiled 1,000 li.

35:48.882 --> 35:50.601
Participants in gambling
shall be flogged 800 times

35:50.601 --> 35:52.121
and fined 100 taels of silver.

35:52.121 --> 35:54.281
All prefectures must strictly investigate
and handle relevant cases.

35:54.281 --> 35:55.402
Anyone who covers it up

35:55.402 --> 35:56.962
shall also be punished.

35:56.962 --> 35:58.121
Thank you, Miss Meng,

35:58.121 --> 35:59.601
for saving us from dire straits.

35:59.601 --> 36:01.042
Thank you, Miss Shen.

36:01.042 --> 36:02.681
Thank you, all of you.

36:02.681 --> 36:03.962
All of you,

36:03.962 --> 36:05.241
don't mention it.

36:05.241 --> 36:06.641
We have already reported to the court

36:06.641 --> 36:08.201
to secure compensation for you all.

36:08.201 --> 36:11.402
For those who wish to return home,
we'll provide travel expenses.

36:11.402 --> 36:14.161
For those who wish to stay in the capital,
we'll arrange proper settlement.

36:14.161 --> 36:15.802
If you have the ambition
to take the Imperial Exam,

36:15.802 --> 36:18.081
the Censorate is willing to recommend you.

36:18.081 --> 36:20.862
The Censorate is your strong backing.

36:21.842 --> 36:22.842
Miss Meng.

36:22.842 --> 36:24.161
Although I have suffered a lot,

36:24.161 --> 36:25.641
I still want to take the Imperial Exam

36:25.641 --> 36:27.322
to obtain a scholarly rank like you

36:27.322 --> 36:28.882
and be a good official.

36:28.882 --> 36:30.681
I'm from a remote frontier town.

36:30.681 --> 36:32.641
Local women are mostly trapped
in their homes.

36:32.641 --> 36:34.442
I wish to return to my hometown and teach.

36:34.442 --> 36:38.641
I want women to know
that they can also blaze their own trails.

36:38.641 --> 36:41.322
It is indeed harder for women
to live in this world than men.

36:41.322 --> 36:44.721
But as long as you have hope,
you'll dispel the clouds and see the sun.

36:44.721 --> 36:48.641
We are relieved to see
that you have such aspirations.

36:48.641 --> 36:52.721
Studying can certainly give people hope.

36:52.721 --> 36:53.842
Thank you, Miss Meng.

36:53.842 --> 36:55.241
Thank you, Miss Shen.

36:55.241 --> 36:57.261
Both of you are models for women.

37:35.802 --> 37:37.721
You're in big trouble.

37:37.721 --> 37:40.522
Yet you're actually playing this.

37:40.522 --> 37:42.322
Brother, are you so anxious

37:42.322 --> 37:47.081
because you're afraid of being implicated?

37:47.081 --> 37:50.442
Hao Wen Ming is now being cross-examined
under torture in Censorate.

37:50.442 --> 37:53.081
How long do you think
he can hold out before he talks?

37:53.081 --> 37:55.522
If he dares to utter even a single word,

37:55.522 --> 37:56.882
I will kill his whole family.

37:56.882 --> 37:57.962
If you don't restrain yourself,

37:57.962 --> 38:00.181
the Divine Guard will come next time.

38:01.241 --> 38:03.942
How formidable you look.

38:05.362 --> 38:10.661
When you used my business involving beauties
to pave the way for your own promotion,

38:11.802 --> 38:14.241
why didn't I see you show any mercy?

38:14.241 --> 38:18.462
Now that the scandal is exposed,
you want to kick down the ladder.

38:19.081 --> 38:21.522
The gambling ban makes me lose a fortune.

38:21.522 --> 38:23.362
There is no way to let this go.

38:23.362 --> 38:25.362
You are utterly crazy.

38:25.362 --> 38:29.422
Do you want to sacrifice me
for your gain again?

38:31.241 --> 38:32.281
Over the years,

38:32.281 --> 38:35.641
[Account book]
all your dirty money has been recorded.

38:35.641 --> 38:39.042
The Censorate will certainly be interested.

38:39.042 --> 38:43.721
Don't worry.
I value family ties more than you do.

38:43.721 --> 38:46.542
After all, you are my only blood relative.

38:47.561 --> 38:49.141
Regarding the past incident,

38:50.681 --> 38:52.482
I am sorry to you.

38:52.482 --> 38:56.302
But I had no other choice back then.

38:57.842 --> 39:00.181
Although you and I were not born
of the same mother,

39:01.042 --> 39:04.022
when you were pinned in the mud,
crying for help,

39:04.681 --> 39:08.342
and calling me brother,
I have remembered it for 20 years.

39:11.322 --> 39:16.042
Do you think the Huxiao Gang
has come this far by sheer luck?

39:16.042 --> 39:17.581
So now,

39:18.442 --> 39:21.681
can you invalidate the gambling ban?

39:21.681 --> 39:24.022
I will do my utmost to maneuver in the court.

39:25.882 --> 39:27.681
But you must restrain yourself a bit.

39:27.681 --> 39:30.902
For now,
don't make a move against Meng Ting Hui.
